{"ref":"BDB, בַּד","hw":"בַּד","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בַּד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּ֑ד</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>white linen (</strong>deriv. unknown<strong>)</strong> pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּדִּים—אֵפוֹד בָּ֑ד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.18\">1 S 2:18</a> (Samuel), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.18\">1 S 22:18</a> (priests of Nob), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.14\">2 S 6:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.27\">1 Ch 15:27</a> (David): in P as material of diff. priestly vestments <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:42\" href=\"/Exodus.28.42\">Ex 28:42</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:28\" href=\"/Exodus.39.28\">39:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.3\">Lv 6:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.4\">16:4</a><sup>(×4)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.32\">32</a>. Pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">(ה)לבושׁ (הַ)בַּדִּים</span> clad in (the) <em>linen garments</em>, of angel <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.2\">Ez 9:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.2\">10:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:5\" href=\"/Daniel.10.5\">Dn 10:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:6\" href=\"/Daniel.12.6\">12:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:7\" href=\"/Daniel.12.7\">7</a>.","next":"BDB, בַּד²","prev":"BDB, בִּגְתָ֫נָא"}